&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="line-height: 1; text-align: left"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 35px; line-height: 19px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;④　投資計画&lt;/p&gt;
